# Formal proofs and reachability covers for Cummings SNUG-2002 Rev 1.3 async FIFO (fifo1.v): proves no overflow or underflow, exact in-order data delivery, and single-bit Gray pointer transitions across async clocks (catches broken/wrong_full_bit.patch).
[tasks]
cummings_proof fifo prove
cummings_reach fifo cover
gray_proof gray prove

[options]
prove: mode prove
cover: mode cover
cover: depth 40
multiclock on

[engines]
prove: abc pdr
cover: smtbmc yices

[script]
read -formal fifomem.v sync_r2w.v sync_w2r.v rptr_empty.v wptr_full.v fifo1.v cummings_formal.sv
fifo: prep -top cummings_formal
gray: prep -top gray_ptr_rules

[files]
../fifomem.v
../sync_r2w.v
../sync_w2r.v
../rptr_empty.v
../wptr_full.v
../fifo1.v
cummings_formal.sv
